   "prose": "A causal self-attention layer reads three tokens with embeddings $(1, 0)$, $(0, 1)$ and $(1, 1)$, with $\\mathbf W_Q = \\mathbf W_K = \\mathbf W_V = \\mathbf I$ and width $d = 2$.",
